  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The impact of package selection and versioning on single-cell RNA-seq analysis (2025) in CaltechDATA. 1 documented downstream reuse(s).</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The impact of package selection and versioning on single-cell RNA-seq analysis (2025) in CaltechDATA is authored by Rich, Joseph and Pachter, Lior. Topics: Computer science, Selection (genetic algorithm), Software versioning, Data mining and R package.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">No citations yet.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
